# Publish ignore (ADR-0111). Its mere PRESENCE makes npm stop consulting the repo `.gitignore`
# when packing — without it, the gitignored `migrations-bundle/` build artifact (a runtime asset
# the generator reads via `import.meta.url`) is dropped from the tarball even though `package.json`
# `files` lists it (npm/cli#4360). The `files` allowlist is the real selector (dist + templates +
# migrations-bundle); this file only neutralizes the `.gitignore`-as-npmignore fallback. Source
# (`src/`, configs, tests) is excluded BY OMISSION from `files`, never shipped.
